        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Close the cock and wait for 1 minute.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        735.83589,
        244.87636600000027,
        726.5923024640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check that the air leak tester reading remains at or above the limit value.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        721.3160423999999,
        409.5558820000005,
        712.0724548640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Repair limit : 1.4 kPa (0.014 bar, 0.0142 kg/cm 2 , 0.203 psi)",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        87.84101800000002,
        693.8356871999999,
        399.6194464000002,
        681.7722556640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If the pressure is below the limit value, check for the locations of air leakage.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46000999999998,
        673.5560699999999,
        426.2932899999997,
        664.3124824640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        73.2606184,
        662.0366783999999,
        105.83968240000002,
        652.7930908640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check for air leakage from the sound of air escaping when pressure is applied.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        73.2606184,
        650.5766904,
        437.3618823999997,
        641.3331028640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ELECTRIC EQUIPOTENTIAL TEST",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        633.1283071800001,
        236.6360531294001,
        622.9816016630056
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After assembling the Li-ion battery pack, remove the battery pack upper case ground bolt , then measure the resistance between the high-voltage harness connector flange ground bolts and the ground bolt seat (location of coating peeling) .",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46000999999998,
        618.65589,
        559.9425159999996,
        584.5118584640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46000999999998,
        370.07541840000005,
        107.58932199999992,
        360.83183086408843
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To prevent electric shock, wear insulated protective gear.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        80.28036999999998,
        347.8152504,
        364.5439264000002,
        338.5716628640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Standard : Less than 0.1 Ω",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        87.84012160000003,
        291.172232,
        236.79804160000003,
        278.3936719999999
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If the result deviates from the standard value, check the following and correct the malfunction location.",
      "page_pdf": 271,
      "page_manual": "EVB-271",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
